OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a cyclist
OL,7,Fwas seriously injured in a crash in
OL,8,FLeicester.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to Scraptoft Lane - close to the
OL,12,Fjunction with Barbara Avenue - just
OL,13,Fafter 22:00 BST on Monday, following a
OL,14,Freport of the crash involving a blue
OL,15,FToyota Yaris and pushbike.
OL,17,FThe force said the cyclist, a man in
OL,18,Fhis 40s, was taken to hospital with
OL,19,Fserious injuries and was continuing to
OL,20,Freceive treatment.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
